{"id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-analysis-omega-theory.md","title":"Analysis and Its Omega-Rule Closure","display":"df-analysis-omega-theory — Analysis and Its Omega-Rule Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-analysis-omega-theory","aliases":["89-df-analysis-omega-theory"],"display":"df-analysis-omega-theory — Analysis and Its Omega-Rule Closure","depends_on":["[[89-df-omega-rule]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-analysis-omega-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-analysis-omega-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-analysis-omega-theory — Analysis and Its Omega-Rule Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b\" href=\"?note=e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b\" title=\"89-df-omega-rule\">89-df-omega-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_2\">\\(\\mathcal L_2\\)</span> 为二阶算术语言：数变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span>、各有限元数的关系变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i^{(k)}\">\\(X_i^{(k)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S\">\\(0,S\\)</span>、等号、成员/关系应用、布尔联结词及两类量词。公式为这些标记构造子的有限语法树。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Log}_2\">\\(\\mathsf{Log}_2\\)</span> 是固定的经典多类一阶逻辑演算（关系变量作相应类型的对象量化）；不把标准满二阶语义有效式全体作为公理。</li>\n<li>全称闭合模式：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\ne Sx\">\\(0\\ne Sx\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sx=Sy\\to x=y\">\\(Sx=Sy\\to x=y\\)</span>；二阶归纳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X0\\land\\forall x(Xx\\to X(Sx))\\to\\forall xXx\">\\(X0\\land\\forall x(Xx\\to X(Sx))\\to\\forall xXx\\)</span>；全理解 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists X^{(k)}\\forall\\bar x(X\\bar x\\leftrightarrow A(\\bar x))\">\\(\\exists X^{(k)}\\forall\\bar x(X\\bar x\\leftrightarrow A(\\bar x))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中自由出现，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可含二阶量词与参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\)</span> 为这些模式与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Log}_2\">\\(\\mathsf{Log}_2\\)</span> 逻辑公理的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> 为通常有限逻辑规则。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_2\\subseteq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_2)\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_2\">\\(\\mathcal R_2\\subseteq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_2)\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\)</span> 为所固定经典演算的有限前提规则关系，包含 MP 与两类全称化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_2\\)</span> 分别为该语言公式及闭句集合。其逻辑公理和规则作为此条明确的基础演算接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}omega\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\ \n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2(\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\ \n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2\\cup\\mathcal R_\\omega^{\\mathrm{An}}\n(\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}omega\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\ \n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2(\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\ \n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2\\cup\\mathcal R_\\omega^{\\mathrm{An}}\n(\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 14 章，印刷页 177–179；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n先在全部公式集上对固定演算闭合，再取闭句部分，避免把开放逻辑公理要求为闭句集的成员。模式集可枚举，普通可证性与完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 可证性的复杂度不同。原书证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{An}\">\\(\\mathrm{An}\\)</span> 可定义加法、乘法并包含 PA；本条没有把完整二阶有效性（不可有效公理化）误当作该可枚举公理理论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-omega-rule","status":"resolved","id":"e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_2","display":false},{"tex":"v_i","display":false},{"tex":"X_i^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"0,S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Log}_2","display":false},{"tex":"0\\ne Sx","display":false},{"tex":"Sx=Sy\\to x=y","display":false},{"tex":"X0\\land\\forall x(Xx\\to X(Sx))\\to\\forall xXx","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists X^{(k)}\\forall\\bar x(X\\bar x\\leftrightarrow A(\\bar x))","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Log}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_2\\subseteq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_2)\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}omega\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\ \n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2(\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\ \n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2\\cup\\mathcal R_\\omega^{\\mathrm{An}}\n(\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{An}","display":false}],"bytes":2690,"backlinks":[{"id":"43a8d98c9b5fc94d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"571457cbee377421","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bb08f01f5311762f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB},\\mathrm{GLSB}$ 取既有双模态定理集；$\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})$ 是 [[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]] 定义的普通分析闭句定理集。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-rule]] → [[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]] → [[89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b","a257e5b1de6880b7","2e7227755a8473e0"]}